Subject: [PATCH] boot: restore full graphics in the kexec source baseline

Apply to the one-line boot-header-cmdline.txt extracted from the verified
8b3a4a3a source boot image, then repack only the v4 cmdline field in a fresh
copy. Remove the source GPU blacklist and page-owner profiling. Keep the
Image, header sizes, ramdisk and padding unchanged. This does not remove
compiled diagnostic hooks or establish that kexec itself is repaired.

The new source baseline must boot full Android with the original GPU
module, SurfaceFlinger and system_server running. Do not use the former
KGSL-blocked runners: those intentionally stop SurfaceFlinger and require
GPU absence. No helper, kexec load or jump belongs to this boot-only check.

--- a/boot-header-cmdline.txt
+++ b/boot-header-cmdline.txt
@@ -1 +1 @@
-ramoops.console_flush_diag=1 page_owner=on module_blacklist=msm_kgsl
+ramoops.console_flush_diag=1
